    "description": "Scotsman commercial ice machine full-spectrum troubleshooting across all five SoCal counties. Six condition categories: production failure (no ice), low production, ice quality (cloudy, thin), water leaks, unusual noises, and cleaning/maintenance. Prodigy ELITE C-Series cube (C0322 through C1448) horizontal evaporator with spray pump architecture, AutoAlert alphanumeric E01-E09 diagnostic codes (E01 long freeze, E02 long harvest, E04 no water sensed, E05 high refrigerant pressure, E08 water pump short cycling, E09 bin sensor). Brilliance nugget (N0422, N0622, N0922) NS001-NS003 mechanical drive codes plus extrusion mechanism. Legacy MV/C/DC-Series cube + SCN compact + EH flake + HID dispenser. Scotsman-specific spray pump replacement (year 6-9 service item, $380-$540), Nu-Calgon brand-spec cleaner, post-2020 R-290 hydrocarbon refrigerant transition. EPA 608 Universal plus R-290 certified. Ali Group Vernon Hills parts network. $120 commercial diagnostic. BHGS #A49573, EPA 608 Universal #1346255700410.",
    "provider": { "@id": canonical + "#business" },
